legacy-peer-deps=true

# Why: eslint@10 + eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y@6.10.2 has an unfixed peer
# dep mismatch (jsx-a11y still declares `eslint ^3..^9`). Without
# this flag, `npm ci` in CI fails immediately with ERESOLVE — every
# frontend CI job (lint / typecheck / build / test) has been silently
# red. Same flag is what local installs already use implicitly.
#
# Alternative would be to pin eslint ^9 or wait for jsx-a11y 7.x to
# accept eslint 10. Tracked as known technical debt.
